      "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:26:57.922Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Try saving your report as Report Type: Report Builder and enabling “Is Standard Report” in the settings. Frappe charts can only visualize non-filtered, non-paginated data, so disable pagination and filters to test. Then recreate your chart using Source: Report</p>",
